# The files the vendoring script carries into a repository, one per line:
# a class, a space, the path in the target. A comment runs to the end of its
# line. Handbook: /handbook/adoption/README.md owns what each class means.
#
#   pointer  a one-paragraph leaf at the path of a shared page, pointing at
#            its home here; taken from pointers/<path>, overwritten on update
#   shared   a tooling file, copied byte for byte, overwritten on update
#   stub     installed once from stubs/<path>, never overwritten, never
#            required

pointer handbook/meta/handbook/README.md
pointer handbook/meta/authoring/README.md
pointer handbook/meta/experiments/README.md
pointer handbook/meta/forms/README.md
pointer handbook/meta/growth/README.md
pointer handbook/meta/style/README.md
shared .claude/rules/prose-authoring.md
shared .claude/skills/docs-consistency/SKILL.md
shared .claude/skills/docs-consistency/scripts/check-handbook.sh
shared .claude/skills/handbook-update/SKILL.md
shared .claude/commands/docs/check.md
shared .claude/commands/handbook/update.md
stub AGENTS.md
stub CLAUDE.md
stub handbook/README.md
stub handbook/meta/README.md
stub handbook/meta/glossary/README.md
stub handbook/meta/local/README.md
stub experiments/README.md
